 switchport mode trunk
 switchport trunk allowed vlan 104-107,112-115,136-139,144-147,168-169,171,176-177,179-181,184-185,208-211,997-998
 switchport nonegotiate
 speed auto
 duplex auto
 channel-group 1 mode active
 no shutdown
